# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# `*.pyc` is already covered by `*.py[cod]` above; kept explicit so the
# harness's own required entry is visible here by name. (A trailing `#`
# comment on a pattern line is pattern text to git, not a comment -- the
# line that used to sit here matched nothing; DEF-551 found it, DEF-635
# removed it.)
*.pyc
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
dist/
build*/
*.egg

